  "NewsSummary": "Plaques unveiling ceremony was held on Friday December 05, 2003 at 2:00 PM in Aga Khan University (AKU) Lecture Hall. Eight independent plaques, sandblasted with the names of donors endowed professorships for research, scholarship and information tec",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass8F01D086A63D4477B189BEC3E4C5DC4D\"><div>Plaques unveiling ceremony was held on Friday December 05, 2003 at 2&#58;00 PM in Aga Khan University (AKU) Lecture Hall. Eight independent plaques, sandblasted with the names of donors endowed professorships for research, scholarship and information technology, were unveiled by Saidullah Khan Dehlavi, Chairman, Board of Trustees of AKU.&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>The ceremony was attended by 120 people, which included members of the Board of Trustees, donors, their guests, senior management and conveners of Aga Khan University's Resource Development Committee worldwide and in Pakistan. The recognition plaques are placed in the Medical College Courtyard.</div></div>",
